{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Preserve the producer offloader for forwarded errors.** Child contexts forward an inner operation's `ErrorObject`, but this resolves its envelope using the child's offloader. If the inner step/invoke used a different operation-level offloader, handling or replay raises `PayloadOffloadException` instead of returning the expected branch failure. Rebind forwarded `errorData` to the child policy or retain the producer offloader, with a differing-offloader nested failure/replay test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ogVqL","finding_digest":"6ce7d5093a139ac001c38e145c80185660969182950602459b7d70e24b053df8","finding_id":"arf_v1_ntt5kcj2conmaaodrykfzaaykz","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::propagated-exception-offloader-preservation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::propagated-exception-offloader-preservation","line":268,"observation_digest":"de411b4771783762bc51a21f32ca564d53ad8ef297b5a82aec7aa9e6ab1f461e","observation_id":"aro_v1_3zarwr3rpa3wfpcruiptfsswjv","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T04:32:26Z","review_id":"arr_v1_67m2avxtdegta6ou2vtjblow23","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"8b41c737c9707ad1ddf819406f2e8ac93b7c0f28","reviewer":"codex","start_line":268,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_o7zeiqdiu56wgt6azohf2bjzfo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T04:32:26Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
